%% Application lifecycle (APP): app_application.status. DRAFT exists in the schema but the current flow never stores it.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> AwaitingDeposit : Student submits the form (FR-APP-02)
  AwaitingDeposit --> AwaitingRoommate : Deposit confirmed, invited roommate not ready (FR-APP-03)
  AwaitingRoommate --> Submitted : roommate's Deposit confirmed (FR-APP-03)
  AwaitingDeposit --> Submitted : Manager confirms the Deposit claim (FR-BIL-03)
  AwaitingDeposit --> Expired : Deposit window ends without a claim (job, FR-APP-04)
  AwaitingDeposit --> Cancelled : Student cancels, or a second claim is rejected (FR-APP-04)
  AwaitingRoommate --> Cancelled : Student cancels (FR-APP-04)
  Submitted --> UnderReview : Manager opens the review (FR-APP-05)
  Submitted --> Approved : Manager approves (FR-APP-05)
  UnderReview --> Approved : Manager approves (FR-APP-05)
  UnderReview --> Rejected : Manager rejects with a reason (FR-APP-05)
  Submitted --> Rejected : Manager rejects, or the student is not enrolled (FR-APP-05, FR-AUTH-08)
  Approved --> Allocated : assignment approved for the Block (FR-ASG-03)
  Approved --> Waitlisted : no matching Bed left (FR-ASG-03)
  Waitlisted --> Allocated : Round-2 offer accepted (FR-APP-07)
  Allocated --> Forfeited : Balance not paid by its deadline (job, FR-ASG-11)
  Expired --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  Forfeited --> [*]
  Allocated --> [*] : stay ends at check-out

  AwaitingDeposit : Awaiting Deposit
  AwaitingRoommate : Awaiting Roommate
  UnderReview : Under Review
